{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"90c36200e366fe86","type":"text","text":"## ZFC axioms\n\n1. Extensionality: $$\\forall X \\ \\forall Y \\ (\\forall u \\ (u \\in X \\leftrightarrow u \\in Y) \\rightarrow X = Y)$$\n2. Empty set: $$\\exists X\\  \\forall u  \\ (u \\not \\in X)$$\n3. Pair: \n$$\\forall X  \\ \\forall Y \\ \\exists Z \\ (\\forall u \\ (u \\in Z \\leftrightarrow (u = X \\vee  u = Y))$$\n4. Separation schema: $$\\forall X \\ \\exists Y \\ (u \\in X \\wedge \\Phi(u)))$$\n5. Union: $$\\forall X \\ \\exists Y \\ (u \\in Y \\leftrightarrow \\exists v \\ (v \\in X \\wedge u \\in v))$$\n6. Power set: $$\\forall X \\ \\exists Y \\ (u \\in Y \\leftrightarrow u \\subseteq X)$$\n7. Infinity: $$\\mathrm{Ind}(x) := \\emptyset \\in x  \\wedge \\forall u \\ (u \\in x \\rightarrow u \\cup \\{u \\} \\in x); \\ \\exists X \\ \\mathrm{Ind}(X)$$\n8. Replacement schema: $$\\forall x \\ \\forall y_1\\  \\forall y_2 \\ (\\Phi(x, y_1) \\wedge \\Phi(x, y_2) ) \\to y_1 = y_2) \\rightarrow \\forall X \\ \\exists Y \\ \\forall y \\ (y \\in Y \\leftrightarrow \\exists x \\ ( x \\in X \\wedge \\Phi(x, y)))$$\n9. Regularity: $$\\forall X \\ ( X \\neq \\emptyset \\rightarrow \\exists u \\ (u \\in X \\wedge X \\cap u = \\emptyset)) $$\n10. Choice: $$\\forall X \\ (\\emptyset \\not \\in X \\rightarrow \\exists f \\ (f: X \\to \\bigcup X \\wedge \\forall u \\in X \\ f(u \\in u)) )$$","x":-940,"y":-580,"width":700,"height":880},
		{"id":"f583b1ecb7d0a0cc","type":"text","text":"## Relations\n\n- $R \\subseteq X \\times Y$, $P \\circ R$\n- $f: X \\to Y$\n- $\\sim$, $X / \\sim$\n- Important types:\n\t- Equivalence\n\t- Preorder\n\t- Partial order\n\t- Linear order\n\n\\* Category of partial orders $\\mathcal{P}oset$ ","x":-220,"y":-80,"width":540,"height":380},
		{"id":"5f576fbdf48a1519","type":"text","text":"## Framework basics\n- $x \\in X$\n- $X \\subseteq Y$\n- $\\emptyset$, $\\{X\\}$, $(X, Y)$, $\\{ X, Y\\}$\n\n","x":-220,"y":-580,"width":540,"height":220},
		{"id":"97054107c291a884","type":"text","text":"## Operations\n\n- $\\{ x \\in X \\mid P(x) \\}$\n-  $\\bigcap X$, $\\bigcup X$\n- $X \\cap Y$,  $X \\cup Y$, $X \\setminus Y$\n- $X \\times Y$, $X + Y$\n- $\\mathcal{P}(X)$, $X^Y$","x":-220,"y":-340,"width":540,"height":240},
